---
description: Indexes, eager loading, pagination, and no N+1
globs: app/**/*.php,database/migrations/**/*.php
alwaysApply: false
---

# Queries & indexes

- Index every foreign key and columns used in `where` / `orderBy` / `groupBy` (dates, status, `student_id`, `account_id`, etc.).
- No N+1: eager load with `with()`. Call `Model::preventLazyLoading()` in non-production (`AppServiceProvider`).
- Always paginate list queries. Use `chunk()` / `lazy()` for large exports — never `->get()` on unbounded sets.

```php
// ❌ BAD
$students = Student::all();
foreach ($students as $s) { $s->enrollments; }

// ✅ GOOD
Student::with('enrollments')->orderBy('name')->paginate(25);
```
